WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.252
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:06.547
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.547 --> 00:00:10.047
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:10.047 --> 00:00:10.378
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:10.378 --> 00:00:13.805
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:17.449
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:22.822
Switch the process view to ordinary inference.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:28.694
Switch to retrieval-augmented generation.

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:32.017
Compare the three processes in the matrix.

00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:36.473
Choose Available context for the new prompt definition.

00:00:36.473 --> 00:00:42.487
Reveal why a prompt definition does not retrain the model.

00:00:42.487 --> 00:00:47.076
Choose retrieval-augmented generation for document search.

00:00:47.076 --> 00:00:50.370
Reveal the retrieval explanation.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:54.851
Reject unsupported claims about weights and guaranteed accuracy.

00:00:54.851 --> 00:01:00.874
Reveal the final explanation.

00:01:00.874 --> 00:01:06.800
Review all three revealed checks and the score.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:13.838
Reset the choices and return to the process selector.
